WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.294
This is my dad, Carlos. He's very busy!

2
00:00:04.744 --> 00:00:08.134
He wakes up at six. He drinks coffee every morning.

3
00:00:10.384 --> 00:00:12.799
He takes a shower and goes to work by bus.

4
00:00:15.049 --> 00:00:18.531
He works in an office. He finishes work at five p.m.

5
00:00:20.781 --> 00:00:25.193
After that, he goes to the gym. At night, he studies English.

6
00:00:27.443 --> 00:00:31.112
Finally, he goes to bed at eleven. Good night, Dad!

